    turnFlow: "1. Lead: Dealer's left leads any card to start the trick. 2. Follow: Players must follow suit if they hold a card of that suit. 3. Draw: If unable to follow suit, draw one-by-one until a playable card is found. 4. Joker: Can be played anytime to win the trick; if led, the next player sets the suit. 5. Next: Winner of the trick leads the next one. 6. Page One!: Call 'Page One!' when down to one card.",
